<title>USA: SoftNet Systems sales up after acquisition.</title>
<headline>SoftNet Systems sales up after acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoftNet Systems Inc said Wednesday buying Micrographic Technology Corp last fall helped its fourth-quarter revenues climb 55 percent to $9.5 million.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $334,948 in the period, compared to a loss of $8.1 million one year ago. The latest results include a $3.8-million gain from the sale of securities, SoftNet Systems said.</p>
<p>SoftNet Systems markets a line of information management software and a hardware system that allows electronic data retrieval.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
